{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"547276dc7faabb6cadc4641526cc7f9df161e0e0851ee82ffd226cdae98487e4","ja":"のり子の決断","zh":"诺莉子的决定","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2547f9a10c2cf3053be9d26c91327a5cd90e1d8d578ffcd02be568977c0dda3a","ja":"（病院に行くと、本番は棄権することになっちゃう。\nせっかく、みんなが応援してくれてるのに……）","zh":"（要是去医院的话，正式演出就只能弃权了。\n难得大家都在为我加油……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"75be008c711a36d32f2dd49e0cd58fa4f61ea98807b16cf876f6d023d241c9d3","ja":"（でも、体調崩した子も放っておけないし……）","zh":"（但是，也不能不管身体不舒服的孩子……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"00e61df2fa2a9b8199df16549701cd6b1b767fa880f211dcdef38f4ad55252dc","ja":"……話は聞かせていただきました。\n福田さん、どうぞご自分の心に正直に。","zh":"……事情我已经听说了。\n福田，请遵从你自己的本心吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3b33527a084ea95cd9e7a2d2897b4f16a3a8e43fc02a3e0098e75cb35226265d","ja":"紬……！　ひなたと翼も？","zh":"紬……！　日向和翼也在？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1626a8cf6093822779281de1407208681a05ff25feb29f178b156a54ad362591","ja":"あたしは、のり子さんと走れただけで満足だよぉ。\n今は、その人の体調を心配してあげてほしいべさ。","zh":"能和法子小姐一起跑我就很满足了呀。\n现在，还是多担心担心那个人的身体状况吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"2cfb54b704f9199785ae7adbde7b9335c6830f57624dc2212623f754aa3e180c","ja":"うんうん♪　それに、困ってる人を助ける\nアイドルって、すっごくカッコイイと思いま～す！","zh":"嗯嗯♪　而且，我觉得去帮助身陷困境之人的\n偶像，真的超级帅气～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"df3d864894cdc1f1448f96f906cbebc75c8f8fea28e56f5696fe7c4db9c5b930","ja":"みんな……ありがと！\nじゃあ、いってくるよっ！","zh":"大家……谢谢！\n那我出发啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e","ja":"そして……","zh":"然后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"e73286642923eaeb3d2e519b21dd6824858e72fdf38ab0135d98db1f3179d304","ja":"（大きな病気じゃなくてよかった。\nけど、もうこんな時間か……）","zh":"（幸好不是什么大病。\n不过，都这个时间了啊……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"e2ae42bbf63f42f3131840b825d81b3bca9bdf4ef0d6bb17d308758c6eeddea2","ja":"あ、のり子さーん！　おかえりなさい！\n急いで急いで！　今から表彰式ですよ～！","zh":"啊，法子小姐——！欢迎回来！\n快点快点！马上就是颁奖典礼了哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"c9f8a462e1fdbb3c93ece7bb5d51fc72c3fb265d67391c83cb48553decfa988e","ja":"へっ！？　急いでって、なんで……？","zh":"咦！？你说要抓紧，究竟是为什么……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"269657cb4af39c378a01b804588b4c2908548066637a0d7fd15e974a236ee74f","ja":"リハーサルの映像を、ネットで流してたそうでねぇ、\n視聴者さんの声が、なまら届いてるんだって。","zh":"排练的视频好像在网上播出了，\n说是收到了观众们超多留言呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"663df3a9e66a287d4d7a8a90d2c32df31295742d7206dd706df6cb0f6a0ab361","ja":"それで急きょ、福田さんに特別賞をと。\nおめでとうございます！","zh":"所以就临时决定，给福田颁发特别奖。\n恭喜你！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"7dba2acb639b1787b0e59694d3a6098c1591b65979fd3765403408c5d9035955","ja":"ええ～っ！？","zh":"诶诶～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[60].text","source_sha256":"f397ffd19d7d5ea9218d1bad19f838fb81b38612ba6722939d5c25555f6f36fd","ja":"表彰式も終わって……","zh":"颁奖仪式也结束了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[61].text","source_sha256":"9188f5274115332de1049bdf52df6bd5ee73657ae6b4c84c17b21f4502bab2e9","ja":"みんなのおかげで、最高の日になったよ！\nありがとね。何かお礼できたらいいんだけど……。","zh":"多亏了大家，今天成了最棒的一天！\n谢谢你们。要是能好好答谢大家就好了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[62].text","source_sha256":"ebdf2d674c702b2cdf247aa9beebb2f6ebec861a487d96190deed83b860e738f","ja":"あっ、それならわたしも、バイクに乗せてくださ～い！\n夕焼けが見える丘とか、ロマンチックかも～♪","zh":"啊，那我也想坐摩托车～！\n去能看到晚霞的山丘之类的，说不定会很浪漫呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[70].text","source_sha256":"ce040cf6519f456882e8cdcdc76752efa313e046bdf7e1113f85b99e19322d81","ja":"あたしは、今度はコスモス畑の中を\nのり子さんと走ってみたいなぁ。","zh":"我想下次和大波斯菊盛开的花田里\n和典子小姐一起跑跑看呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[71].text","source_sha256":"fdb5a2d9761e758416a79da2542107ce4c0297b85134ce1e076deb7f87717d79","ja":"私も、またぜひ。次は、甘味処などで\n休憩するのも、良いのではと。","zh":"我也一定会再去的。我觉得下次去甜品店之类的地方\n休息一下，应该也很不错。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1483.unity3d","item_key":"commands[79].text","source_sha256":"a02c8f76b2b80937cca13ca854163cd419fd027c35eb532c8883b88c3d9187b7","ja":"あはは、オッケー！\nどこへだって、アタシがみんなを連れていくよっ！","zh":"啊哈哈，没问题！\n无论去哪里，我都带大家一起去！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
